  abilityId: 1850558
  abilityName: Blinding Isochronism
  abilityDesc: 22 combo Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    8 combo Light attack on single foe (partial HP drain), boosts Def, Rec relative
    to Atk for 3 turns, boosts Atk, Def, Rec and critical rate (Light) for 3 turns,
    fills BB gauge for 3 turns & adds Light shield for 3 turns
